cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "DSLO v0.8 — Federated Geometry Constellation"

message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."

type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: Slowicki
    given-names: Donald
    affiliation: "Inda Moment Incorporated"

abstract: >
  DSLO v0.8 is the canonical federated geometry expansion of the Semantic
  Substrate Specification. It introduces federated geometry, domain-class
  geometry, invariant surfaces, mapping surfaces, registry anchors, and
  DSLO-native formatting surfaces. Version 0.8 is strictly additive,
  geometry-only, invariant-preserving, non-runtime, and non-agentic. It
  inherits exclusively from DSLO v0.7 substrate and manifold lineage. This
  citation file provides structured metadata for scientific indexing,
  federated geometry ingestion, and cross-surface archival stability.

